  "body": "– 20 Acres in a Prime Location, positioned at the Junction of Silverdale, Dairy Flat & Stillwater\r\n\r\nThis exceptional 8.114-hectare (20-acre) property offers a rare combination of convenience, lifestyle appeal, and future development potential. Situated at the meeting point of Silverdale, Dairy Flat, and Stillwater, it enjoys easy access to SH1 via the Silverdale motorway exit and is just minutes from the soon-to-be-completed Penlink motorway, providing seamless north-south connectivity.\r\n\r\nThe land boasts gently rolling elevations, rising towards East Coast Road, which forms the natural ridgeline between Dairy Flat and Stillwater. Its unique contours create a visually striking landscape, offering an inspiring foundation for architectural excellence and visionary development.\r\n\r\nFuture-Proof Your Investment\r\n\r\nFrom the existing home, you can enjoy distant sea views over Orewa, adding an extra touch of tranquillity. \r\nThe property is currently zoned Countryside Living, while just across East Coast Road, you'll find Future Urban and General Business Zones—an exciting prospect for landbanking, rezoning or an ambitious development project. Whether you're considering a prestigious residential enclave, an aged care estate or a boutique lifestyle retreat, this property is brimming with possibilities.\r\n\r\nExisting Infrastructure & Equestrian Appeal\r\n\r\nThe property features a solid brick home with three bedrooms, one bathroom, and two living areas, along with an expansive water tank beneath the balcony.  Additional structures include a three-car garage and a functional stable, making it an ideal choice for equestrian lovers or those seeking rural tranquillity close to urban conveniences.\r\n\r\nA Once-in-a-Lifetime Opportunity\r\n\r\nWith the owner retiring and stepping away from property investment, this is a rare chance to secure a significant landholding in a high-growth corridor.\r\n\r\nBring Your Vision & Unlock This Property’s Full Potential!",
